":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-18T17:36:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T21:18:04Z","closed_at":"2025-08-20T21:18:03Z","assignee":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5 master branch 8aa37cab8950351d96f541581abdc42136283f24\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (8aa37cab8) - Void #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat Aug  2 03:38:07 UTC 2025 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti Laptop GPU - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900H (20 threads) - 15.28 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI had this piece of code that was working fine in godot 4.4 and doing what I needed it to do:\n\nhttps://github.com/dementive/gsg/blob/bd34055c99ec9a8ae3d4eaf8d690a02df8441cf6/src/gsg/tools/MapEditor.cpp#L213C1-L218C19\n\n```cpp\nNode *owner = node->get_owner();\nif (owner != nullptr) {\n\tEditorInterface::get_singleton()->edit_node(MapEditorPlugin::map_editor_node);\n\towner->remove_child(node);\n}\nmemdelete(node);\n```\n\nAfter upgrading to 4.5 this now crashes the editor. This is what it shows me in the debugger:\n\n<img width=\"1880\" height=\"730\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70da48d0-e157-4673-97e8-9d7901f4a713\" />\n\nI checked out that code and git blamed it and it looks like whatever causes the crash was added in this commit: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d492b665c39013818a34e5f411d64e9ada1c9737\n\nI tried to edit the code where it was crashing to have a nullptr check like this:\n```cpp\nvoid SceneTreeDock::clear_previous_node_selection() {\n\tfor (Node *node : node_previous_selection) {\n\t\tif (node ==  nullptr) {\n\t\t\tcontinue;\n\t\t}\n\t\tnode->disconnect(CoreStringName(script_changed), callable_mp(this, &SceneTreeDock::_queue_update_script_button));\n\t}\n\tnode_previous_selection.clear();\n}\n```\n\nIt didn't work though, I still got the same crash in the clear_previous_node_selection function. I also tried changing my memdelete to queue_free and changing the order they are called and that also made no difference.\n\n\nI was able to get around this by just not calling queue_free on the node (I actually need to call edit_node here as part of the algorithm or it makes the UI interaction very clunky, I can't get around that) but that isn't a great solution since it just leaks the memory now. It doesn't really matter in my case that it leaks memory, I could leak 10k of these and it'd be no problem, but either way having to choose between a crash and memory leak isn't really ideal because the leak prints out a hundred lines yelling at me when I close the program.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCall edit_node and then queue_free/memdelete the currently edited node in the editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can probably test this with a few lines in a tool script.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109745/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}